# [free_energy] (D161) on the CPU, scenario differences of
# Inputs/check_free_energy.py: ethanol decoupled from TIP3P (Inputs/fep).
# dH/dλ of the Coulomb, the Lennard-Jones, and a component of expressions
# against central differences of the energies of the states beside it, and
# the energies of the other states against runs at those states, in double
# and mixed precision.
#
# RUN: rm -rf %t && mkdir -p %t
# RUN: %python %S/Inputs/check_free_energy.py %t CPU DOUBLE mdir differences | FileCheck %s
# RUN: rm -rf %t-mixed && mkdir -p %t-mixed
# RUN: %python %S/Inputs/check_free_energy.py %t-mixed CPU MIXED mdir differences | FileCheck %s
#
# CHECK: dH/dl against central differences: ok
# CHECK: the energies of the other states: ok
# CHECK: free energy differences passed
